### Sunucu saglik kontrolu
GET http://localhost:3000/health

###

### Tum notlari listele
GET http://localhost:3000/notes

###

### Baslikta arama yap (?q=)
GET http://localhost:3000/notes?q=express

###

### Tek not getir (var olan id)
GET http://localhost:3000/notes/1

###

### Tek not getir (olmayan id -> 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/notes/999

###

### Yeni not olustur (201)
POST http://localhost:3000/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ilk notum",
  "content": "Express ile API yazmak gercekten ogretic"
}

###

### Gecersiz not olustur - title eksik (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "basliksiz not"
}

###

### Gecersiz not olustur - title bos (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "   ",
  "content": "bos baslik"
}

###

### Notu guncelle (200)
PUT http://localhost:3000/notes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Guncellenmis baslik",
  "content": "Yeni icerik burada"
}

###

### Notu guncelle - olmayan id (404)
PUT http://localhost:3000/notes/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hayalet not"
}

###

### Notu guncelle - gecersiz body (400)
PUT http://localhost:3000/notes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": ""
}

###

### Notu sil (204)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/notes/1

###

### Notu sil - olmayan id (404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/notes/999

###
